             the re-run should include calmer seeds (start from bin 5) so precision is exercised.",

  real_findings: [
    "H2 (35% excursion reduction, W=0, p=8e-7) is REAL but is a REACTIVE-reallocation capability (S3 acts
     faster at onset), not S4 anticipation. Record it as a genuine control finding; do NOT inflate it to
     anticipation.",
    "H4 (regime guard) works — the OOB directive was rejected, projection_invalid, no reallocation. Solid.",
    "The reallocation MECHANISM is sound (the loop closes and demonstrably helps); the PROJECTOR is what
